<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts SITA as &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts SITA as &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sita, the waste management unit of France's Lyonnaise des Eaux, was rated &quot;hold&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
